    <description>Case button Callback Reached: the agent reached the customer on a sales call-back. A campaign answer goes through Svc_CampaignResponse (the same as the response page): Offer keeps the Case open for Create Opportunity, Not now / Not interested close it as Succesfull. Other closes it without touching the campaign member. Processed by dealer: sales picks the dealer (prefilled with the account's Preferred Installation Specialist, otherwise its Kickback Reseller, when that is a dealer or distributor); the member gets it as Dealer__c.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fDealerDefault</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>BLANKVALUE({!vPreferredDealerId}, {!vKickbackDealerId})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fDescription</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT(IF(ISBLANK({!rCase.Description}), &apos;&apos;, {!rCase.Description} &amp; BR()) &amp; TEXT(TODAY()) &amp; &apos; Reached&apos; &amp; IF(ISBLANK({!txtNote}), &apos;&apos;, &apos; - &apos; &amp; {!txtNote}), 32000)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fNextQuarter</name>
        <dataType>Date</dataType>
        <expression>ADDMONTHS(DATE(YEAR(TODAY()), FLOOR((MONTH(TODAY()) - 1) / 3) * 3 + 1, 1), 3)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>scr - Case - Callback Reached {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>scr - Case - Callback Reached</label>
